<title>UK: Nomura sets call warrants on Nikkei OTC Avg index.</title>
<headline>Nomura sets call warrants on Nikkei OTC Avg index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nomura International Plc said it has issued 500,000 American-style call warrants on the Nikkei OTC Average Index.</p>
<p>One warrant controls 10 units of the index.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,153.51 YEN	    PREMIUM	14.75 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     $8.50		     GEARING	6.78 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 08.MAY.97-17.MAY.98   PAYDATE	07.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE  NOMED3</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
